# Forth: ANS Forth / Forth 2012 Standard, Core word set; requirements/languages/forth.md
name     forth fth 4th

keyword  if else then do loop +loop begin until while repeat again case of endof endcase exit recurse
keyword  variable constant value create does> allot cells cell+ immediate postpone literal to defer is
builtin  dup drop swap over rot nip tuck pick roll emit cr type key accept . .s ! @ c! c@ +! here
fold-case

ident-part     -+>@!.?
line-comment   \
block-comment  ( )
string   " "
prefix   . s c
operators  :;+-*/<>=
